    "source": {
      "section": "Strict-plain overlay > No contractions",
      "quote": "Write the full form. 'Do not' is harder to misread than 'don't', for people who read English as a second language and for translation tools."
    },
    "message": "Strict-plain text uses full forms. A contraction is easy to misread for readers of English as a second language, and the negative in 'can't' or 'don't' is easy to miss.",
    "fix": "Write the full form, for example 'do not' or 'cannot'.",
